  "ruleText": "Ins 2001.11 Manner and Intent of Notification. The manner and intent of notifications of claim benefit determinations shall be in accordance with the requirements of RSA 420-E:4.\n\nSource. #5931, eff 12-5-94, EXPIRED: 12-5-00\n\nNew. #7683, eff 6-1-02; ss by #9721-A, eff 6-11-10; ss by #12545, eff 6-11-18",
